    </command:details>
    <maml:description>
      <maml:para>Removes a completer registration identified by registration key, native command, or command parameter target. Managed registrations are removed from both the PowerShell runtime and the module's registration table. Runtime-only registrations require -AllowUnmanaged before they can be removed.</maml:para>
    </maml:description>
